#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; is a simple snake duel game for the <ulink url=\"http://www.kde."
"org\">K Desktop Environment</ulink>. You can play &kappname; against the "
"computer or a friend. The aim of the game is to live longer than your "
"opponent. To do that, avoid running into a wall, your own tail and that of "
"your opponent."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; je jednostavna duel zmija igra za <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org"
"\">K Okruženje Desktopa</ulink>. Možete je igrati &kappname; protiv "
"kompjutera ili prijatelja. Cilj igre je da preživiti duže od vašeg "
"protivnika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ksnake; is a simple Snake-like game for the <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org"
"\">K Desktop Environment</ulink>. The aim of &ksnake; is to survive as long "
"as possible and eat as many fruits as you can."
msgstr ""
"&ksnake; je jednostavna zmijolika igra za <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org"
"\">K Okreuženje Desktopa</ulink>. Cilj &ksnake; je da preživit što duže i "
"pojedete što više vočki."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can switch between these games using the game type selector in the "
"configuration dialog."
msgstr ""
"Možete mijenjati ove igre koristeći oadbir tipa igre u podešavajućem "
"dijalogu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Playing &kappname;"
msgstr "Igranje &kappname;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:110 index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Pravila"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once a round is started, the players do not stop moving forward (unless the "
"game is paused). All you have to do is avoid crashing by changing your "
"players direction. Additionally you can try to hinder your opponent. For "
"this it is possible to increase the velocity by pressing your accelerator "
"key."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što runda počne, igrači se ne prestaju kretati (osim ako je igra "
"zaustavljena). Sve što trebate uraditi je izbjegavati sudare mjenjajući "
"pravac vašeg igrača. Također možete pokušati onesposobiti portivnika. U tu "
"svrhu moguće je ubrzati igri koristeći dugme za ubrzavanje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A round starts when all human players press a direction key. The initial "
"moving direction is then in this direction."
msgstr ""
"Runda počinje kada svi igrači pritisnu tipku za pravac. Pa je prvi smjer "
"kretanja upravo onaj koji ste pritisnuli."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to interrupt playing, select <guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem> "
"from the <guimenu>Game</guimenu> menu or hit the keyboard shortcut (see "
"section <link linkend=\"keys\">Default Shortcuts</link>). Additionally the "
"game is paused when the game loses the keyboard focus, &eg; when switching "
"to an other window."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite prekinuti igru, odaberite <guimenuitem>Zaustavi</guimenuitem> iz "
"<guimenu>Igra</guimenu> menija ili pritisnite kraticu sa tastature "
"(pogledajte odabir <link linkend=\"keys\">Osnovne Kratice</link>). Igra je "
"također zaustavljena kada se izgubi fokus sa tastature, &eg; usljed "
"mijenjanja prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To continue the game, select the menu item <guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem> "
"again, or the keyboard shortcut. The game will also continue if the human "
"players press one of their direction keys. But be careful, your player "
"switches to this direction immediately."
msgstr ""
"Da bi ste nastavili igru, odaberite stavke menija <guimenuitem>Zaustavi</"
"guimenuitem> opet, ili kratice sa tastature. Igra će se također nastaviti "
"ukoliko igrač pritisne tipku pravca.Ali budite oprezni, vaš igrač se onda "
"počne kretati u tom smjeru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A game consists of several rounds, and ends if a player has at least nine "
"points, and additionally two more points than the opponent. The current "
"score is always displayed in the status bar."
msgstr ""
"Igra se sastoji od više rundi, i završava ako bili koji igrač ima devet "
"poena,ili dva poena više od protivnika. Trenutni rezultat je uvijek prikazan "
"u statusnoj traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the difficulty level of the game using the game menu item or "
"the select box on the status bar. The difficulty influences the speed of the "
"game and the computer player."
msgstr ""
"Možete promjeniti težinski nivo koristeći stavku sa menija igre ili "
"odabitačku kutiju sa statusne trake. Nivo utjeće na brzinu igre i vašeg "
"protivnika ako je on kompjuter."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Computer Player"
msgstr "Računar kao Igrač"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can play against a computer. The difficulty level of the game influences "
"the intelligence of the computer player."
msgstr ""
"Možete igrati protiv kompjutera. Težina igre utječe na inteligenciju koju "
"računar koristi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At low levels the computer doesn't care about the opponent and just moves "
"around. At higher skill levels the computer tries to hinder the opponent "
"when he comes near."
msgstr ""
"Na nižim nivoima komjuter ne obraća pažnju na igrača već se samo kreće "
"uokolo. Na višim nivoima kompjuter pokušava onesposobiti igrača kada mu se "
"približi."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Keyboard"
msgstr "Korištenje Tastature"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each player has five keys. Four keys for changing the direction and one to "
"accelerate."
msgstr ""
"Svaki igrač ima pet tipki. Četiri za mjenjanje smjera i peta za ubrzavanje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The direction keys do not have to be held down. Simply press them once to "
"change the direction of your player."
msgstr ""
"Tipke za smjer ne trebat držati. Jednostavno ih jednom pritisnite te tako "
"promjenite smjer vašeg igrača."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Acceleration only occurs while the acceleration key remains depressed. When "
"you release the acceleration key, velocity returns to normal."
msgstr ""
"Ubrzavanje se događa samo dok držite tipku za ubrzavanje. Kada je pustite, "
"brzina se vraća u normalu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:184 index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can alter the keys using the shortcuts option in the <ulink url=\"help:/"
"fundamentals/shortcuts.html\"><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Možete promjeniti tipke koristeći moućnosti kratice u <ulink url=\"help:/"
"fundamentals/shortcuts.html\"><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> meniju</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Playing &ksnake;"
msgstr "Igranje &ksnake;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the game is started, the player does not stop moving forward (unless "
"the game is paused). All you have to do is avoid crashing by changing your "
"direction. A game starts when you press a direction key. The initial moving "
"direction is then in this direction."
msgstr ""
"Kada igra započne, igrači se ne prestaju kretati (osim ako je igra "
"zaustavljena). Sve što treba da uradite je da izbjegavate sudare mjenjajući "
"vaš smjer.Igra počinje kada pritisnete tipku za smjer. Tada je vaš početni "
"smjer onaj koji ste pritisnuli kako bi započeli igru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to pause playing, select <guimenu>Pause</guimenu> from the "
"<guimenuitem>Game</guimenuitem> menu or hit the keyboard shortcut (see "
"section <link linkend=\"keys\">Default Shortcuts</link>). Additionally the "
"game is paused when the game loses the keyboard focus, &eg; when switching "
"to an other window."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite zaustaviti igru, oaberite <guimenu>Zaustavi</guimenu> iz "
"<guimenuitem>Igra</guimenuitem> menija ili pritisnite kratice sa tastature "
"(pogledajte odabir <link linkend=\"keys\">Osnovne Kratice</link>). Dodatne "
"igra je zaustavljena kada se izgubi fokus sa tastature, &eg; pri mjenjanju "
"prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To continue the game, select the menu item <guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem> "
"or hit the keyboard shortcut again. The game will also continue if you press "
"one of the direction keys. But be careful, your player switches to this "
"direction immediately."
msgstr ""
"Da bi ste nastavili igru, odaberite stavke menija <guimenuitem>Zaustavi</"
"guimenuitem> opet ili opet kratice sa tastature. Igra će se također "
"nastaviti ukoliko pritisnete tipku pravca.Ali budite oprezni, vaš igrač se "
"onda počne kretati u tom smjeru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the game there will always be a piece of fruit on the map. If you collect "
"it your score will increase with 5 points. The current score is always "
"displayed in the status bar."
msgstr ""
"U igre se na mapi nalazi vočka. Ako je pojedete vaš rezultat će se "
"poboljšati za 5 poena. Trenutni rezultat je uvijek prikazan na statusnoj "
"traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are moving through the map there will appear obstacles. Hitting "
"them will also result in a crash. However, every time an obstacle appears "
"and you survive you'll be rewarded 2 points"
msgstr ""
"Kada se krećete kroz mapu pojavit će se prepreke. Udaranje u njih rezultuje "
"sudarom. Međutim, svaki put kada se pojavi prepreka i vi preživite dodjeliti "
"će vam se po 2 poena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the difficulty level of the game using the game menu item or "
"the select box on the status bar. The difficulty influences the speed of the "
"game."
msgstr ""
"Možete mjenjati težinu igre koristeći stavku sa menija igre ili birajuće "
"kutije sa statusne trake. Težina utječe na brzinu igre."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the keyboard"
msgstr "Korištenje tastature"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each player has four keys. These are used for changing the direction. The "
"direction keys do not have to be held down. Simply press them once to change "
"the direction of your player."
msgstr ""
"Svaki igrač ima četiri tipke. One se koriste za odabiranje smjera. One ne "
"moraju da se drže. Jednostavno ih samo jednom pritisnite te tako će te "
"promjeniti smjer vašeg igrača."

