"Opens a <link linkend=\"configuration\">comprehensive dialog</link> to "
"configure various options."
msgstr ""
"Otvara <link linkend=\"configuration\">opsežan dijalog</link> da podesite "
"razne mogućnosti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &ksnake; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Pored svega &ksnake; ima i obične &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i  "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> stavke sa menija, za više informacija pročitajte "
"odjeljak o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Meni za "
"Postavke</ulink> i  <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help"
"\">Pomoćni Meni</ulink> &kde; Osnove."

